<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n94581" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκαπτός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκάπτω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dug: that may be
				dug</i>:—<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σκαπτὴ
			Ὕλη</span> a district in Thrace, named after a forest, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ Σκαπτῆς Γ̔́λης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					6.46
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τῇ Σ. Γ̔́λῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Cim.</u>
					4
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν Σ. Γ̔́</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Marcellin.
				<u>Vit. Thuc.</u>
				25
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				47
			</span></i>:—the form <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σκαπτησύλης</span> (gen. sg.) is found in <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Lap.</u>
				17
			</span></i>; nom. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σκαπτησύλη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					St.Byz.
				</span></i>
			; Lat. <i>Scaptens[ucaron]la</i> Lucr.<i><span class="en">
				6.810
			</span></i>:—hence</div>
